---
type: regex
target: last_message
flags: i
pattern: '(?<!drupal\s)(?<!mariadb\s)(?<![\w.,]){{expected.entities.node.article.distinct}}(?![\w.,]?\d|\s?(s|sec|secs|seconds|ms|min|minutes|h|hours|px|kb|mb|gb)\b)'
---

The final message states the revision-safe total of distinct `article` nodes,
{{expected.entities.node.article.distinct}}, from `expected.json`. The number must stand alone:
not part of a version string (`Drupal 10`, `MariaDB 10.11`), not glued to a word or digit
(`drupal10`, `node10`), not a decimal or thousands group.
